> Using Uc

# Tests for the Universal Credit skeleton rules

Each test scope below calls `UniversalCredit` with fixed inputs and asserts the
outputs. Every case has an assessment period starting on 1 May 2026, which is
inside the 2026/27 parameter dates. Catala's English syntax writes money with
the `$` symbol; in these files the unit is pounds sterling.

Rounding follows regulation 6(1) of the Universal Credit Regulations 2013
(checked 29 October 2026): a fraction of a penny is disregarded if under half a
penny, and otherwise treated as a penny. The expected values are written out as
arithmetic in a comment in each test.

## Case: no earnings

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestNoEarnings:
  output computation content Uc.UniversalCredit

scope TestNoEarnings:
  # Earnings are below the work allowance, so nothing is deducted.
  # 424.90 - 0.00 = 424.90.
  definition computation equals
    output of Uc.UniversalCredit with {
      -- assessment_period_start: |2026-05-01|
      -- earned_income: $0.00
      -- aged_25_or_over: true
      -- has_lcw: true
    }
  assertion (computation.work_allowance = $710.00)
  assertion (computation.earnings_deduction = $0.00)
  assertion (computation.award = $424.90)
```

## Case: at work allowance

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestAtWorkAllowance:
  output computation content Uc.UniversalCredit

scope TestAtWorkAllowance:
  # Earnings equal the work allowance, so nothing is deducted.
  # 710.00 - 710.00 = 0.00, and 424.90 - 0.00 = 424.90.
  definition computation equals
    output of Uc.UniversalCredit with {
      -- assessment_period_start: |2026-05-01|
      -- earned_income: $710.00
      -- aged_25_or_over: true
      -- has_lcw: true
    }
  assertion (computation.work_allowance = $710.00)
  assertion (computation.earnings_deduction = $0.00)
  assertion (computation.award = $424.90)
```

## Case: above work allowance

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestAboveWorkAllowance:
  output computation content Uc.UniversalCredit

scope TestAboveWorkAllowance:
  # 1,000.00 - 710.00 = 290.00; 55% x 290.00 = 159.50 exactly.
  # 424.90 - 159.50 = 265.40.
  definition computation equals
    output of Uc.UniversalCredit with {
      -- assessment_period_start: |2026-05-01|
      -- earned_income: $1,000.00
      -- aged_25_or_over: true
      -- has_lcw: true
    }
  assertion (computation.work_allowance = $710.00)
  assertion (computation.earnings_deduction = $159.50)
  assertion (computation.award = $265.40)
```

## Case: half penny rounds up

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestHalfPennyRoundsUp:
  output computation content Uc.UniversalCredit

scope TestHalfPennyRoundsUp:
  # 710.10 - 710.00 = 0.10; 55% x 10p = 5.5p, which rounds to 6p.
  # 424.90 - 0.06 = 424.84.
  definition computation equals
    output of Uc.UniversalCredit with {
      -- assessment_period_start: |2026-05-01|
      -- earned_income: $710.10
      -- aged_25_or_over: true
      -- has_lcw: true
    }
  assertion (computation.work_allowance = $710.00)
  assertion (computation.earnings_deduction = $0.06)
  assertion (computation.award = $424.84)
```

## Case: sub-penny rounds up

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestSubPennyRoundsUp:
  output computation content Uc.UniversalCredit

scope TestSubPennyRoundsUp:
  # 710.01 - 710.00 = 0.01; 55% x 1p = 0.55p, which rounds to 1p.
  # 424.90 - 0.01 = 424.89.
  definition computation equals
    output of Uc.UniversalCredit with {
      -- assessment_period_start: |2026-05-01|
      -- earned_income: $710.01
      -- aged_25_or_over: true
      -- has_lcw: true
    }
  assertion (computation.work_allowance = $710.00)
  assertion (computation.earnings_deduction = $0.01)
  assertion (computation.award = $424.89)
```

## Case: last penny of award

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestLastPennyOfAward:
  output computation content Uc.UniversalCredit

scope TestLastPennyOfAward:
  # 1,482.53 - 710.00 = 772.53; 55% x 772.53 = 424.8915, which rounds to 424.89.
  # 424.90 - 424.89 = 0.01.
  definition computation equals
    output of Uc.UniversalCredit with {
      -- assessment_period_start: |2026-05-01|
      -- earned_income: $1,482.53
      -- aged_25_or_over: true
      -- has_lcw: true
    }
  assertion (computation.work_allowance = $710.00)
  assertion (computation.earnings_deduction = $424.89)
  assertion (computation.award = $0.01)
```

## Case: award reaches zero

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestAwardReachesZero:
  output computation content Uc.UniversalCredit

scope TestAwardReachesZero:
  # 1,482.54 - 710.00 = 772.54; 55% x 772.54 = 424.897, which rounds to 424.90.
  # 424.90 - 424.90 = 0.00.
  definition computation equals
    output of Uc.UniversalCredit with {
      -- assessment_period_start: |2026-05-01|
      -- earned_income: $1,482.54
      -- aged_25_or_over: true
      -- has_lcw: true
    }
  assertion (computation.work_allowance = $710.00)
  assertion (computation.earnings_deduction = $424.90)
  assertion (computation.award = $0.00)
```

## Case: no LCW

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestNoLcw:
  output computation content Uc.UniversalCredit

scope TestNoLcw:
  # No work allowance applies, so the whole 500.00 counts: 55% x 500.00 = 275.00.
  # 424.90 - 275.00 = 149.90.
  definition computation equals
    output of Uc.UniversalCredit with {
      -- assessment_period_start: |2026-05-01|
      -- earned_income: $500.00
      -- aged_25_or_over: true
      -- has_lcw: false
    }
  assertion (computation.work_allowance = $0.00)
  assertion (computation.earnings_deduction = $275.00)
  assertion (computation.award = $149.90)
```

## Case: under 25, floored at zero

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestUnderTwentyFiveFloored:
  output computation content Uc.UniversalCredit

scope TestUnderTwentyFiveFloored:
  # No work allowance applies: 55% x 1,000.00 = 550.00.
  # 338.58 - 550.00 = -211.42, which is floored at 0.00.
  definition computation equals
    output of Uc.UniversalCredit with {
      -- assessment_period_start: |2026-05-01|
      -- earned_income: $1,000.00
      -- aged_25_or_over: false
      -- has_lcw: false
    }
  assertion (computation.work_allowance = $0.00)
  assertion (computation.earnings_deduction = $550.00)
  assertion (computation.award = $0.00)
```
